      "title": {
        "en": "Practical Demonstration: trend identification",
        "zh": "实践展示：通过结构、斜率与参与度识别趋势质量"
      },
      "prompt": {
        "en": "Using a demo account, TradingView, FXReplay, MT5 demo or another approved charting platform, demonstrate identifying trend quality through structure, slope and participation. Annotate the evidence, entry condition, invalidation, stop loss, take profit and risk control, then explain why the demonstration follows the written rules.",
        "zh": "使用模拟账户、TradingView、FXReplay、MT5模拟版或其他获准图表平台展示通过结构、斜率与参与度识别趋势质量。标注证据、入场条件、失效条件、止损、止盈与风险控制，并解释该展示为何符合书面规则。"
      },
      "instructions": {
